codex
The bounded trace confirms the program itself reaches the `bin` call normally; the divergence is entirely the semantics’ eager symbolic normalization of the recursive digit function. I’m redesigning the candidate to build digits with an explicit `while` loop and proving that loop with a descending quotient invariant. This exposes the recursion as a K circularity, which is exactly what the kit prescribes for an unbounded domain.
